          "text": "Q1/Q2 Withholding Review and Quarterly Filing Prep"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Prepared for the Harbor Light meeting by Sylvia Nakamura, Payroll Specialist. This document summarizes the Q1/Q2 withholding review for Blue Fir, including the amended Q1 Oregon filing, tip allocation corrections, and the checklist for Q2 filings due July 31."
        },
        {
          "kind": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Overview"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Blue Fir's payroll is processed in-house. This review covers federal Form 941 and Oregon Form OQ for Q1 and Q2 of 2025, with emphasis on tip allocation corrections and withholding accuracy. The Q1 Oregon return was amended in May to fix a tip-allocation error; the amended filing and payment confirmation are in the payroll folder."
        },
        {
          "kind": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Q1 Amendment"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "The Q1 Oregon withholding return (Form OQ) was amended in May due to a tip-allocation error. The correction resulted in additional Oregon withholding tax due. The amended return and payment confirmation are filed and maintained in the payroll folder. Any state notice regarding Q1 almost certainly crossed in the mail with the amendment; please forward any such notices to Payroll for reconciliation."
        },
        {
          "kind": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Q2 Review Summary"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Q2 withholding was reviewed for accuracy against payroll registers. No material exceptions noted. Tip allocation was applied consistently with the corrected methodology from Q1."
        },
        {
          "kind": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Quarterly Filing Checklist (Due July 31, 2025)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "list",
          "ordered": true,
          "items": [
            "Confirm Q2 payroll registers match general ledger.",
            "Reconcile federal tax deposits (941) for Q2.",
            "Reconcile Oregon withholding deposits (OQ) for Q2.",
            "Prepare and file Form 941 by July 31.",
            "Prepare and file Oregon Form OQ by July 31.",
            "Document tip allocation methodology for Q2.",
            "File confirmation copies in payroll folder."
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Key Contacts and References"
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": ["Item", "Location"],
          "rows": [
